research/preregistrations/M8_PREREGISTRATION.md      -text
research/preregistrations/M8_PREREGISTRATION.sha256  -text

# M9 pre-registration — same byte-integrity guarantee as the M7 and M8 frozen artifacts.
research/preregistrations/M9_PREREGISTRATION.md      -text
